 ],
 "synopsis": "Indiabulls Limited has entered into a definitive agreement to acquire a 70% stake in Fintech Cloud Private Limited from its founder Sachin Mittal in an all-share transaction. The deal values Fintech Cloud at approximately Rs. 1,500 crore, with consideration pegged at Rs. 1,050 crore, subject to regulatory and shareholder approvals. Fintech Cloud, founded in 2021, reported revenue of Rs. 133.77 crore and a profit before tax of Rs. 30.31 crore in FY26. The transaction is pending necessary approvals.",
